---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Privacy Policy"
  description="Eurocert privacy policy \u2014 how we collect, use and protect personal data."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/privacy-policy/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367707/eurocert/pp1.png.png" alt="Privacy Policy" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/70 to-[#030a16]/40"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Data Protection</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Privacy <span class="text-eurogold-400">Policy</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/40 text-sm heading-font mt-4"><span class="text-white/70">Privacy Policy</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Data Processing</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Your Consent <span class="text-euro-600">Matters</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We and our partners store or access information on devices, such as cookies and process personal data, such as unique identifiers and standard information sent by a device for the purposes described below. You may click to consent to our and our 824 partners&#x27; processing for such purposes. Alternatively, you may click to refuse to consent, or access more detailed information and change your preferences before consenting.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Your preferences will apply to this website only. Please note that some processing of your personal data may not require your consent, but you have a right to object to such processing.</p><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 border border-euro-100"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-white text-lg"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Data Protection Officer</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">For more information please contact our Data Protection Officer by email at<!-- --> <a href="mailto:info@eurocert.in" class="text-euro-600 font-medium hover:underline">info@eurocert.in</a></p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Your Privacy Matters</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">How We Protect Your Data</h2><p class="text-white/40 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Eurocert is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal information.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-database text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Information We Collect</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">We collect personal information such as name, email, phone number, and company details when you contact us, request services, or register for training programs.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">How We Use Information</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your information is used to provide certification and audit services, communicate about our offerings, process inquiries, and improve our services.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-lock text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Data Security</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-share-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Information Sharing</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">We do not sell or rent your personal information. Data may be shared with accreditation bodies or regulatory authorities only as required by law.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cookie-bite text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Cookies &amp; Tracking</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our website may use cookies to enhance user experience. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings at any time.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center text-eurogold-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-2">Your Rights</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us to exercise these rights or for any privacy-related queries.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Privacy <span class="text-euro-600">Concerns?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">Contact our team for any data privacy questions or to exercise your rights under applicable data protection laws.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white bg-euro-600 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-euro-700 transition-all shadow-lg" href="/contact">Contact Us <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
